.TH DANBY-ATWOODPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-atwoodpendulum \- simulate the swinging Atwood machine
.SH DESCRIPTION
One mass swings while the counterweight constrains the total string length.
Radial motion and angular motion are dynamically coupled: centrifugal force
changes the descent and radial speed changes angular speed.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps, R resets, and Q exits.
